      "widgets_values": [
        "# AI 2x enlarger\n\nModel: RealESRGAN_x2plus.pth (native 2x). Put the verified weight in ComfyUI/models/upscale_models. Core ImageUpscaleWithModel uses tiled inference. A native 4x model followed by Lanczos 0.5 produces a 2x delivery.\n\nUse 8-bit SDR inputs. Upload your image/video in the Load node, then queue. For transparency, use the streaming CLI/notebook image path. Video frames are processed independently: check flicker in playback. Video fps and audio come from the source; no frame interpolation.\n\nThe native video graph materializes all frames. For long clips or limited RAM, use scripts/media_upscale.py or AI_Media_Upscaler_Colab.ipynb. See doc/AI_UPSCALER.md.\n\nFastH3 L4: the original generation, VSA receipt, trim and native MP4 remain connected. The new branch starts AFTER trimming and writes a second, enlarged MP4. Use this variant directly in ComfyUI; existing fast_h3_colab.py keeps its native-output contract."
      ]
    }
